{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Egypt.</b> I have called this [verse] about Jerusalem, for he who dwelt in it would be victorious and would not go down [to Egypt]."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "The subject and antecedent of the feminine זאת is implied from context; Ibn Ezra appears to be identifying the addressee of the verse as Jerusalem."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:56.693484114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}